    "preamble": "M/S Synthite Industries (P) Ltd vs Food Safety Officer Chengannur Circle on 3 September, 2024 Author: K. Babu Bench: K. Babu In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present The Honourable Mr.Justice K. Babu Tuesday, the 3rd day of September 2024 / 12th Bhadra, 1946 Crl.Mc No. 7215 Of 2024 Cc 2728/2023 Of Judicial Magistrate Of First Class -I, Chengannur, Alappuzha Petitioner(S)Accused Nos.4 To 7: 1. M/S Synthite Industries (P) Ltd. Spices Division, Synthite Taste Park Building No. Ix/312A, 312B,312C,312D Pancodu, Aikarand Grama Panchayat,Vadavucodu, Ernakulam Represented By Its Nominee U/S 66 Of The Fss Act Anil Kumar , Pin - 682310 2. Anil Kumar, Aged 56 Years, S/O Kumaran Nair K Geetha Bhavan Konnakal P.O. Near Govt Lps Valakom, Muvattupuzha Representing M/S Synthite Industries (P) Ltd. Spices Division, Synthite Taste Park Building No. Ix/312A, 312B,312C,312D Pancodu,Aikarand Grama Panchayat,Vadavucodu, Ernakulam 682310, Pin - 682316 3. Jacob Thomas, Aged 52 Years, Plantharayil, Vazharmangalam Chengannur, Alapuzha Representing Ms/ Intergrow Brands Pvt Ltd Ajay Vihar, M.G.Road, Cochin, Kerala 682016, Pin - 689121 4. Ms/ Intergrow Brands Pvt Ltd Ajay Vihar, M.G.Road, Cochin, Kerala Represented By Its Nominee U/S 66 Of The Fss Act Jacob Thomas , Pin - 682016 Respondent(S)Complainant, State & Another: 1. Food Safety Officer Chengannur Circle, 1St Floor Mini Civil Station Chengannur , Pin - 689121 2. State Of Kerala, Represented By Public Prosecutor, High Court Of Kerala, Pin - 682031 3. The Food Safety And Standards Authority Of India, Science And Standards (S & S) Division, Fba Bhavan, Kotala Road, New Delhi Represented By Its Joint Director (Science And Standards.), Pin - 110002 This Criminal Misc. case coming on for orders, upon persuing the petition and upon hearing the arguments of Sri.PREMJIT Nagendran, Advocates for the petitioners and M/S Vaibhave Sharma,Amit Mehana Sc for R3 ( -Served ON,)and Public PROSECUTOR,for R1 And R2 the court passed 